<title>USA: Honda April US car sales fall, trucks up.</title>
<headline>Honda April US car sales fall, trucks up.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Apr 1-30, 1997     Apr 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    52,876	    60,750	    -13.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,075	     1,651	    +86.3</p>
<p> Import Car		12,070	     9,310	    +29.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	     9,183	     3,270	   +180.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Apr 30, 1997 Jan 1-Apr 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   198,699	   216,035	     -7.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   8,228	     7,531	    +10.3</p>
<p> Import Car		49,204	    38,272	    +29.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    26,158	    10,583	   +149.6</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 102 for year to date vs 103 in year ago.</p>
</text>
